<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>Testing on goalgo</title><link>https://gotogolang.github.io/tags/testing/</link><description>Recent content in Testing on goalgo</description><generator>Hugo</generator><language>en</language><lastBuildDate>Fri, 03 Jan 2025 00:00:00 +0000</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://gotogolang.github.io/tags/testing/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>Package mathutils</title><link>https://gotogolang.github.io/content/exercises/go/go-multi-01/</link><pubDate>Fri, 03 Jan 2025 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://gotogolang.github.io/content/exercises/go/go-multi-01/</guid><description>&lt;p>Build a &lt;code>mathutils&lt;/code> package with three functions over integer slices:&lt;/p>
&lt;table>
 &lt;thead>
 &lt;tr>
 &lt;th>Function&lt;/th>
 &lt;th>Description&lt;/th>
 &lt;/tr>
 &lt;/thead>
 &lt;tbody>
 &lt;tr>
 &lt;td>&lt;code>Max(nums []int) int&lt;/code>&lt;/td>
 &lt;td>maximum element&lt;/td>
 &lt;/tr>
 &lt;tr>
 &lt;td>&lt;code>Min(nums []int) int&lt;/code>&lt;/td>
 &lt;td>minimum element&lt;/td>
 &lt;/tr>
 &lt;tr>
 &lt;td>&lt;code>Sum(nums []int) int&lt;/code>&lt;/td>
 &lt;td>sum of elements&lt;/td>
 &lt;/tr>
 &lt;/tbody>
&lt;/table>
&lt;p>Each function returns &lt;code>0&lt;/code> for an empty slice.&lt;/p>
&lt;p>Edit &lt;code>mathutils/mathutils.go&lt;/code>. Run &lt;code>check&lt;/code> or &lt;code>go test ./...&lt;/code> to verify.&lt;/p>
